# Release-profile nvcc flags for sm_89 (RTX 40 / Ada).
# One flag per line. Text from '#' to end of line is a comment; blank lines are
# ignored. Read by build_solver.{sh,bat} (release profile) and
# build_pool_miner.{sh,bat}. TARI_ARCH_FLAGS, when non-empty, replaces this list.
#
# Measured 2026-10-06 on NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 (16 GB, solver pipeline=2),
# driver 617.14, CUDA 13.4 (nvcc V13.4.59), MSVC VS 18 Build Tools, 340 W
# default power limit, clocks not locked, i5-13600KF. Full tables:
# docs/sm89_results_2026-10-06.md.
# Benchmark: tari_c29_solver_sm_89.exe --count 2000, auto pipeline, 60 s
# warm-up, then 3 runs back to back; median g/s. Keep rule: median >= +0.5%
# and every run above the baseline median. Every kept flag passed the GPU
# recall comparison (4,200 graphs, identical proof set vs the reference).
#   baseline (no flags):   13.622 g/s (13.617 13.622 13.627)
#   final (this file):     13.797 g/s (13.792 13.797 13.798), +1.29%
# Final check 2026-10-07, file-based build, back to back: baseline 13.617
# (13.620 13.617 13.617), final 13.791 (13.791 13.801 13.789), +1.28%;
# final recall PASS (110 proofs, 4,200 graphs).
#
# Checkpointed SeedA (spec 4, docs/seeda_checkpoint.md). No spills with
# CUDA 13.4 for C = 8/16/32. SeedA stage ms at pipeline 1: rehash 12.502,
# C8 12.049, C16 11.643, C32 11.606.
#   C=8   13.715 (+0.68%), C=16 13.722 (+0.73%, one run below baseline: rejected),
#   C=32  13.797 (+1.29%): kept, recall PASS.
-DSEEDA_CHECKPOINT=32
#
# Tested on top of SEEDA_CHECKPOINT=32 (13.793 g/s) and rejected (spec 2,
# docs/spec2_gpu_validation.md; late rounds = 18.4% of trim time):
#   LATE_ROUND_SELF_ZERO_IDX=1 (2a)             13.736  -0.41%
#   TRIM_CUDA_GRAPH=1 (2b)                      11.446  -17.0%
#   2a + 2b                                     11.354  -17.7%
# 2c, against a fresh C32 base of 13.804 g/s:
#   ROUND_LATE_TPB=256 / 512 / 1024             13.799 / 13.768 / 12.909
#   LATE_ROUND_BPB=2 with TPB 256 / 512 / 1024  13.694 / 13.705 / 13.162
#   LATE_ROUND_BPB=4 with TPB 256 / 512 / 1024  13.695 / 13.693 / 13.221
#   LATE_ROUND_BPB=8 with TPB 256 / 512 / 1024  12.796 / 13.140 / 13.131
# ntrims (spec 3, tools/ntrims_sweep.ps1): 50 already exceeds the sweep limits
# (max surviving edges 803,598 > 524,288; 2-core projected busy 0.402 > 0.40),
# so no lower value was tried: default stays 50.
#
# Earlier sweep (2026-10-02, same machine, 1 warm-up + 5 runs, before spec 4):
# rejected ROUND23_TPB=768/960/1024, ROUND23_COUNT_NORMAL_LOAD,
# ROUND1_COUNT_NORMAL_LOAD, ROUND_LATE_TPB=512/1024, ROUND0_DST_HASH group,
# TARI_C29_DEFAULT_NTRIMS=48, FUSE_FINAL_TAIL_CURRENT, SEEDB_REVERSE_LOOP,
# WARP_DST_ATOMICS_LATE (all between +0.02% and -6.64%).
